      "side": 1,
      "message": "this works, but it\u0027s a dangerous pattern. The \"safe\" pattern is to do all the input validation, then clear the calling identity, and then do all the other stuff. It\u0027s hard to predict when something else will rely on you being the system and has been the source of many bugs.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 171,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 171,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "79b02d93a31e902e9ed8e663ee029adafc6ec2b3",
