      "writtenOn": "2020-11-12T18:34:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Is there a legitimate use case for an app to be setting a VCN config without any active SIM at all? Assuming no, what you have now should do just fine, maybe modulo checking SubInfo#simSlotIndex \u003e\u003d 0.\n\nThis is something we are discussing. Given that we do intermittently lose carrier privileges, I was thinking this would make life easier. That said, we did have a discussion about metadata vs actual privilege certs from the SIMs.",
      "parentUuid": "719e1fc3_3b588c7b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 178,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "79b02d93a31e902e9ed8e663ee029adafc6ec2b3",
